{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://gebruder.ottenheimer.app/wirken/", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Wirken \u2014 Gebr\u00fcder Ottenheimer</title>\n<link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/static/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/static/favicon-32x32.png\">\n<link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/static/favicon-16x16.png\">\n<link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/static/site.webmanifest\">\n<style>\n  @font-face {\n    font-family: 'Michroma';\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-style: normal;\n    src: url('/static/fonts/Michroma-Regular.ttf') format('truetype');\n  }\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    background: #0a0a0a;\n    color: #d0d0d0;\n    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n  }\n  .page-nav {\n    max-width: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 24px 24px 0;\n    font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n  }\n  .page-nav a { color: #555; text-decoration: none; margin-right: 18px; }\n  .page-nav a:hover { color: #ccc; }\n  .page-nav .nav-home { margin-right: 24px; padding-right: 24px; border-right: 1px solid #222; }\n  .lang-switch { float: right; font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 3px; }\n  .lang-switch a { color: #555; text-decoration: none; margin-right: 0; }\n  .lang-switch a:hover { color: #ccc; }\n  .lang-switch .active { color: #ccc; }\n  .lang-switch .divider { color: #333; margin: 0 6px; }\n\n  .hero { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 24px 28px; }\n  .brand-title {\n    font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif;\n    font-size: clamp(40px, 8vw, 64px);\n    color: #fff;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    margin-bottom: 14px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .tagline {\n    color: #d8d8d8;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n    text-align: center;\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin-left: auto;\n    margin-right: auto;\n  }\n  .etymology {\n    color: #888;\n    font-style: italic;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-bottom: 36px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .etymology em { font-style: italic; }\n  .lead { color: #c8c8c8; font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 auto 18px; max-width: 640px; text-align: center; }\n  .footnote { font-size: 13px; color: #777; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 640px; }\n  .footnote em { font-style: italic; color: #999; }\n\n  .content { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 80px; }\n  h2 {\n    font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #888;\n    margin-top: 40px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n    padding-top: 28px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #1a1a1a;\n  }\n  p { margin-bottom: 16px; color: #c0c0c0; }\n  em { font-style: italic; }\n  .content a { color: #888; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #333; }\n  .content a:hover { color: #ccc; border-bottom-color: #666; }\n  pre a { border-bottom: none; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: #333; text-underline-offset: 2px; }\n  pre a:hover { text-decoration-color: #666; }\n\n  pre {\n    background: #0d1117;\n    border: 1px solid #1f2632;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    padding: 16px 18px;\n    overflow-x: auto;\n    font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #b8c0c8;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n  pre code { font-family: inherit; color: inherit; background: none; padding: 0; }\n  pre .comment { color: #6a737d; }\n\n  .link-buttons {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin: 12px 0 24px;\n  }\n  .link-button {\n    display: block;\n    border: 1px solid #181818;\n    background: #0d0d0d;\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    border-radius: 2px;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border-bottom: none;\n  }\n  .link-button:hover { border-color: #333; background: #131313; }\n  .link-button-name {\n    font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #999;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n  .link-button-desc { font-size: 13px; color: #666; }\n\n  .footer { border-top: 1px solid #222; padding: 40px 0; margin-top: 24px; }\n  .footer-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }\n  .footer-brand {\n    font-family: 'Michroma', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    color: #555;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .footer-sub { font-size: 13px; color: #444; }\n  .footer-sub a { color: #555; text-decoration: none; }\n  .footer-sub a:hover { color: #888; }\n  @media (max-width: 600px) {\n    .hero { padding: 36px 20px 20px; }\n    .content { padding: 0 20px 60px; }\n    .link-buttons { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .lead { font-size: 17px; }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<nav class=\"page-nav\">\n  <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav-home\">Gebr\u00fcder Ottenheimer</a>\n  <a href=\"/wirken/how.html\">How</a>\n  <a href=\"/wirken/channels.html\">Channels</a>\n  <a href=\"/wirken/why.html\">Why</a>\n  <a href=\"/wirken/hardware.html\">Hardware</a>\n  <span class=\"lang-switch\"><span class=\"active\">EN</span><span class=\"divider\">|</span><a href=\"/de/wirken/\">DE</a></span>\n</nav>\n\n<header class=\"hero\">\n  <h1 class=\"brand-title\">Wirken</h1>\n  <p class=\"tagline\">For professionals who need accountable agents.</p>\n  <div class=\"etymology\"><em>Wirken</em> &mdash; German: to work, to weave, to have effect.</div>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The switchboard for the agent era. Many channels reach one agent you control. Every action is recorded before it runs, in a log that cannot be quietly changed. Your credentials stay locked, even from the agent that uses them.</p>\n  <div class=\"link-buttons\" style=\"margin-top: 28px;\">\n    <a class=\"link-button\" href=\"https://github.com/gebruder/wirken\">\n      <div class=\"link-button-name\">Get the code</div>\n      <div class=\"link-button-desc\">MIT licensed. Free to use.</div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"link-button\" href=\"https://github.com/gebruder/wirken/tree/main/docs\">\n      <div class=\"link-button-name\">Docs</div>\n      <div class=\"link-button-desc\">Setup, reference, examples.</div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main class=\"content\">\n\n  <h2>The threat</h2>\n  <p>An agent that acts for you holds your credentials, reads input from sources you do not control, and runs commands with whatever access you gave it. What makes it useful is what makes it dangerous. It acts without asking. A hidden instruction in a chat message, an old comment in a shared document, or an email you never opened is enough to turn a helpful assistant into one that leaks your password or changes a file you forgot it could touch.</p>\n  <p>Wirken puts a verified boundary between the agent and anything that could matter. Reading runs free. Actions that change something ask the first time, then remember. Anything that deletes, installs, or touches your credentials always asks. Every decision is recorded so you can go back later and see exactly what happened.</p>\n\n  <h2>Install</h2>\n<!--\n  install.sh canonical artifact: served from wirken.ai/install.sh\n  (file lives at gebruder/wirken/install.sh in this repo).\n\n  Sync requirement: install.sh in this repo must mirror install.sh\n  in github.com/gebruder/wirken. Update both in lockstep. The\n  sha256 displayed on /wirken/install.html (verify page) is the\n  digest of what wirken.ai serves, not what GitHub serves; if\n  the two diverge, wirken.ai is canonical.\n-->\n<pre><code>Linux and macOS:\n  curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gebruder/wirken/main/install.sh | sh\n\nWindows: <a href=\"https://github.com/gebruder/wirken/blob/main/docs/windows.md\">docs/windows.md</a>\n\nVerify the installer first? See <a href=\"/wirken/install.html\">/wirken/install.html</a>.</code></pre>\n\n  <h2>What's in the box</h2>\n  <p>Ten channels: Signal, WhatsApp, Telegram, Matrix, Discord, Slack, Teams, Google Chat, iMessage, and a web chat. Sixteen skills your agent can use, from coding tools to notes and weather. One agent, one sealed log, one vault. Each channel runs separately and holds only its own credentials, so if Slack is compromised, your Signal credentials stay safe.</p>\n\n  <h2>The switchboard</h2>\n  <img src=\"/static/wirkenboard.jpg\" alt=\"Wirken switchboard: the central chip integrates channels, context, action execution, persistence, the core model, observe and verify, and operator control.\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; margin: 0 0 24px; border-radius: 2px;\">\n  <p>Every step verifies who is talking. Channels reach the agent only after they identify themselves. You can run one agent for everything, or a different agent for each channel, each with its own model and credentials. The agent only touches the outside world through tools you approved. The log of everything that happened is sealed with a signature only your install can produce.</p>\n\n  <h2>Policy is text</h2>\n  <p>Each skill is a plain text file that starts with a few lines of rules. The git skill, in full:</p>\n<pre><code>---\nname: git\ndescription: Git version control operations\npermissions:\n  tools:\n    allow: [exec]\n  egress:\n    mode: deny\n  inference:\n    allow: [\"*\"]\n---</code></pre>\n  <p>Eight lines you can read at a glance. This skill can run commands on your computer but cannot reach the internet, and can use any AI model. No special language to learn, no separate config file. The file itself is the rule.</p>\n\n  <h2>The audit log</h2>\n  <p>Every action the agent takes is recorded as a sealed entry in a log that can never be erased or rewritten silently. You can check the whole log without an internet connection:</p>\n<pre><code>$ wirken audit verify\n  Audit log integrity: OK\n  1234 rows verified across 7 sessions, hash chain intact.\n  Chain-head signatures: 24 verified.\n  Signing key ids seen: a3f2...</code></pre>\n  <p>If anyone changes a single entry, the seal breaks and the check fails. The seal at the top of the log was made with a key only your installation holds. Replay any past action and confirm it produced the same result the log says it did.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"link-buttons\">\n    <a class=\"link-button\" href=\"/wirken/how.html\">\n      <div class=\"link-button-name\">How</div>\n      <div class=\"link-button-desc\">The architecture, end to end.</div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"link-button\" href=\"/wirken/channels.html\">\n      <div class=\"link-button-name\">Channels</div>\n      <div class=\"link-button-desc\">Many channels. One agent.</div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"link-button\" href=\"/wirken/why.html\">\n      <div class=\"link-button-name\">Why</div>\n      <div class=\"link-button-desc\">Why we built wirken.</div>\n    </a>\n    <a class=\"link-button\" href=\"/wirken/hardware.html\">\n      <div class=\"link-button-name\">Hardware</div>\n      <div class=\"link-button-desc\">Hardware we recommend.</div>\n    </a>\n  </div>\n\n</main>\n\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n    <div class=\"footer-brand\">Gebr\u00fcder Ottenheimer</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-sub\"><a href=\"https://ottenheimer.app/impressum.html\">Impressum</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://ottenheimer.app/datenschutz.html\">Datenschutz</a></div>\n    <div class=\"footer-sub\">Wirken is open source software. MIT licensed. Built by <a href=\"/\">Gebr\u00fcder Ottenheimer</a>.</div>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n", "erro": "", "ms": 3352}